{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It began in 2017 with 1I/\u02bbOumuamua then... 2019 2I/Borisov,\u00a0  3I/ATLAS... in 2025 but\u00a0those were just the first Drops of the storm that came decades later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Year 2201. UltraEarth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another interstellar <strong>E.L.E-class</strong> object is inbound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, ancient, and on a direct course to Our Planet. Panic? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nah! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity barely flinches. After all, the Cosmic Couriers always show up to vaporize these threats before they make headlines\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 <i>they will <strong>try</strong> each time...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of a subcontracted demolition crew\u2014underfunded, overworked, and definitely not first-tier. Your job? Deliver high-yield payloads to the asteroid\u2019s weak points, trigger the detonation sequence, and escape before the shockwave turns you and your teammates into cosmic confetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Solo or Co-op:</strong><br>Fly solo or team up with up to four friends to explore, coordinate deliveries, navigate unstable terrain, and survive the blast radius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>The right Tool for the job:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravitational Boots, Kinetic Shields, OxyProvider Bagpacks, jetpacks, portable powersources and more, manage and share resources with your Teammates to Finish de Mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Deliver the Package:</strong><br>You can explore and find interesting assets, but, once you deliver the Package the mission becomes race against time. Drop the payload, mark the zone, and get out before the countdown hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Lore-Driven Chaos:</strong><br>These asteroids aren\u2019t just rocks\u2014they\u2019re relics. Some whisper. Some resist. Some\u2026 remember. What exactly are we erasing from existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join The Company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have cookies!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923070?t=1767904524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923070?t=1767904524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923070/6fa40ca13b7783ee76acc3685cf498c1b6589952/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767904524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923070/6fa40ca13b7783ee76acc3685cf498c1b6589952/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767904524","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3981900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It began in 2017 with 1I/\u02bbOumuamua then... 2019 2I/Borisov,\u00a0  3I/ATLAS... in 2025 but\u00a0those were just the first Drops of the storm that came decades later.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Year 2201. UltraEarth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another interstellar <strong>E.L.E-class</strong> object is inbound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, ancient, and on a direct course to Our Planet. Panic? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nah! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity barely flinches. After all, the Cosmic Couriers always show up to vaporize these threats before they make headlines\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 <i>they will <strong>try</strong> each time...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re part of a subcontracted demolition crew\u2014underfunded, overworked, and definitely not first-tier. Your job? Deliver high-yield payloads to the asteroid\u2019s weak points, trigger the detonation sequence, and escape before the shockwave turns you and your teammates into cosmic confetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Solo or Co-op:</strong><br>Fly solo or team up with up to four friends to explore, coordinate deliveries, navigate unstable terrain, and survive the blast radius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<strong>The right Tool for the job:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravitational Boots, Kinetic Shields, OxyProvider Bagpacks, jetpacks, portable powersources and more, manage and share resources with your Teammates to Finish de Mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Deliver the Package:</strong><br>You can explore and find interesting assets, but, once you deliver the Package the mission becomes race against time. Drop the payload, mark the zone, and get out before the countdown hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Lore-Driven Chaos:</strong><br>These asteroids aren\u2019t just rocks\u2014they\u2019re relics. Some whisper. Some resist. Some\u2026 remember. What exactly are we erasing from existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join The Company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have cookies!</p>","developers":["FirulaiGamer Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923070/51f1036871224a1483ac78178b6c186d033d428c/header.jpg?t=1767904524","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vide